The repository is a DNA-language-model codebase with custom BERT/RMT implementations, tokenizer and genome-corpus utilities, and downstream-task examples. I’m documenting those separately from pretrained weights and datasets, which are not included as a complete local training bundle.
Created `README.md` in the repository root. It documents the project structure, setup and dependency caveats, model loading, corpus and tokenizer utilities, downstream-task examples, and licensing. No other files were changed.

